# Agent Policy Registry

- Read `docs-governance/AGENT_POLICY_REGISTRY.md` and `docs-governance/SAFE_MODE_CONTRACT.md` before changing agent behavior architecture.
- Every agent change must declare jurisdiction, allowed entities, allowed actions, and escalation/refusal behavior.
- Safe Mode is a runtime contract, not a soft prompt instruction.
- No agent may be treated as universally capable by default.
